# SHA-256 of each file in installer/tv/vendor/ that FoxbloomTVSetup.exe embeds (sdb.exe, Samsung's two CA
# certificates, and adb.exe with its two DLLs). installer/tv/build.ps1 refuses to build when a vendor file has no
# line here or its hash differs, so a swapped or damaged sdb.exe or adb.exe can't be shipped by accident. -NoVendor
# builds don't read this file.
#
# Format: one line per file, "<sha256 in hex>  <file name>" (two spaces, as sha256sum prints it). Lines starting
# with # are comments. Fill it in when supplying the files, e.g.:
#   (Get-FileHash installer\tv\vendor\sdb.exe -Algorithm SHA256).Hash.ToLower() + '  sdb.exe'
#
# sdb.exe: sdb_4.2.36_windows-64.zip (zip SHA-256 829c504d...fc94333c, as Tizen publishes), download.tizen.org
# CA files: tizen-certificate-extension_2.0.75.zip > cert-add-on_2.0.75_windows-64.zip >
#   org.tizen.common.cert_1.0.0.202510211035.jar res/ca/, download.tizen.org
# adb.exe, AdbWinApi.dll, AdbWinUsbApi.dll: Android SDK Platform-Tools 37.0.3 (adb 37.0.3-16887417) for Windows,
#   installed from Google's SDK repository (Android Studio SDK Manager) into %LOCALAPPDATA%\Android\Sdk\platform-tools
adeaabc381fedc9d7ba536d2f272e4ad1a24584673c2bc33ee51f70edb908169  sdb.exe
cdb3fe1ec045513d86fa9257c27b18871f2dd5bdc2a0d65c0c8fdacfa63f44f3  vd_tizen_dev_author_ca.cer
64a9295e8676f902253cc00112b51d58fa099aa5f33d33b2050bb55b0caeedbd  vd_tizen_dev_public2.crt
bae5ce98846b19caa74a34900850caa8b21d01976932b2ad83baeb5de5651aee  adb.exe
ed20abfb8b423029a2278d3947c1a1235774afd1b0e0e08405591e6f1d237a49  AdbWinApi.dll
